2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">周</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7313em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4097em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.093em;vertical-align:-1.4097em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5903em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">如有</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> P2 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">债务</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.2687em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月专项</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7313em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4097em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"度量与进展追踪\">度量与进展追踪</h2><p>技术债清偿的进展必须对非技术利益相关者可见——否则预算会在第二个季度被砍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n<th>与 DORA 关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>部署频率</td>\n<td>单位时间部署次数</td>\n<td>周→日</td>\n<td>直接度量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更前置时间</td>\n<td>代码提交到生产部署的时间</td>\n<td>减少 40%</td>\n<td>直接度量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更失败率</td>\n<td>失败部署/总部署</td>\n<td>&lt; 15%</td>\n<td>直接度量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复时间（MTTR）</td>\n<td>事故到恢复的平均时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 小时</td>\n<td>直接度量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>债务比率（SonarQube）</td>\n<td>技术债估算/总开发工时</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n<td>间接指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖新鲜度</td>\n<td>依赖在支持窗口内的比例</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n<td>安全/稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>速度恢复率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{速度恢复率} = \\frac{V_{t+6} - V_{t}}{V_{t}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">速度恢复率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 t 时刻的团队交付速度。清偿开始 6 个月后速度提升 ≥ 30% 是健康的基准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"向上沟通的翻译框架\">向上沟通的翻译框架</h2><p>技术债对工程师是显然的，但对非技术高管需要翻译：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术指标</th>\n<th>业务翻译</th>\n<th>CFO 语言</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码重复率 40%</td>\n<td>每年维护成本增长 40%</td>\n<td>年增 $X 万运维开支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理解时间 1.5x</td>\n<td>新功能开发效率下降 33%</td>\n<td>功能交付延迟 → 收入延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成 bug 密度 +60%</td>\n<td>客户可见质量下降</td>\n<td>客户流失风险 → 收入损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖过期 30%</td>\n<td>安全攻击面扩大</td>\n<td>合规罚款 + 声誉风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键的沟通原则：<strong>不要说&quot;我们需要重构&quot;，说&quot;如果不投资，每个季度我们的交付成本将增长 15-25%&quot;</strong>。用金融语言描述技术问题是获得预算的唯一可靠途径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ai-时代的新型技术债\">AI 时代的新型技术债</h2><p>ThoughtWorks Radar Vol.34 的&quot;认知债&quot;概念要求更新传统的技术债管理框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传统技术债</th>\n<th>AI 时代新增技术债</th>\n<th>检测方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码坏味道</td>\n<td>不可解释的 AI 生成代码</td>\n<td>代码理解度调研</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过时的依赖</td>\n<td>模型版本锁定 / prompt 漂移</td>\n<td>模型版本审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失的测试</td>\n<td>缺失的 AI 输出评估管道</td>\n<td>eval 覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档不足</td>\n<td>系统行为超出任何人的认知</td>\n<td>&quot;能解释这段逻辑吗&quot;测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>架构耦合</td>\n<td>Agent 工具调用链的不可追溯</td>\n<td>调用链可观测性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>认知债的清偿不能靠重写代码——需要投入在<strong>理解</strong>上：增加可观测性、编写架构决策记录、进行定期的&quot;代码考古&quot;活动让团队成员互相讲解系统行为。这与<a href=\"execution/measuring-tech-investment\">技术投资度量</a>中的&quot;能力投资&quot;维度直接相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>技术债战略清偿的关键转变是从&quot;工程师抱怨&quot;到&quot;商业投资决策&quot;：用量化的利息/本金模型计算 ROI，用优先级框架区分&quot;必须修&quot;和&quot;不值得修&quot;，用确定性的容量承诺（而非&quot;有空再做&quot;）保证执行，用财务语言（而非技术术语）向上沟通。2026 年的新增挑战是 AI 生成代码带来的认知债——这类债务需要投资于理解和文档化，而非传统的代码重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"技术债务战略清偿","id":"技术债务战略清偿"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"技术债的四象限分类","id":"技术债的四象限分类"},{"level":2,"text":"债务量化模型","id":"债务量化模型"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级排序框架","id":"优先级排序框架"},{"level":2,"text":"容量分配策略","id":"容量分配策略"},{"level":2,"text":"度量与进展追踪","id":"度量与进展追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"向上沟通的翻译框架","id":"向上沟通的翻译框架"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 时代的新型技术债","id":"ai-时代的新型技术债"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"迁移路线图规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/execution/migration-roadmap-planning"},"next":{"title":"技术投资度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/execution/measuring-tech-investment"}}